#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:4
msgid "Multi instance"
msgstr "Multi-instance"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:6
msgid "Содержание"
msgstr "Contents"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:8
msgid ""
"**Multi Instance (многоэкземплярная активность)** — способ определения "
"повторения определенного шага в бизнес-процессе."
msgstr ""
"**Multi Instance (multi-instance activity)** — a way to define repetition"
" of a specific step in a business process."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:10
msgid ""
"В концепциях программирования мультиэкземпляр соответствует for each "
"конструкции: он позволяет выполнять определенный шаг или даже полный "
"подпроцесс для каждого элемента в данной коллекции, последовательно или "
"параллельно."
msgstr ""
"In programming concepts, multi-instance corresponds to a for-each "
"construct: it allows executing a specific step or even a complete "
"subprocess for each element in a given collection, sequentially or in "
"parallel."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:12
msgid ""
"Многоэкземплярная активность — обычное действие, для которого определены "
"дополнительные свойства (так называемые multi-instance characteristics), "
"которые заставляют действие выполняться несколько раз во время "
"выполнения."
msgstr ""
"A multi-instance activity is a regular activity for which additional "
"properties (so-called multi-instance characteristics) are defined, "
"causing the activity to execute multiple times during runtime."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:14
msgid "Следующие действия могут стать действиями с несколькими экземплярами:"
msgstr "The following activities can become multi-instance activities:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:16
msgid "Пользовательская задача;"
msgstr "User Task;"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:17
msgid "Задача-сценарий;"
msgstr "Script Task;"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:18
msgid "Подпроцесс."
msgstr "Subprocess."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:20
msgid "В редакторе Multi Instance можно установить следующим образом:"
msgstr "In the editor, Multi Instance can be set as follows:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:27
msgid "Sequential и Parallel Multi Instance"
msgstr "Sequential and Parallel Multi Instance"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst
msgid "Sequential Multi Instance"
msgstr "Sequential Multi Instance"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Sequential Multi Instance** — последовательная активность с несколькими"
" экземплярами."
msgstr ""
"**Sequential Multi Instance** — sequential activity with multiple "
"instances."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:39
msgid ""
"Экземпляры выполняются друг за другом. Когда один экземпляр завершен, "
"создается новый экземпляр для следующего элемента в ``inputCollection``."
msgstr ""
"Instances are executed one after another. When one instance is completed,"
" a new instance is created for the next element in the "
"``inputCollection``."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst
msgid "Parallel Multi Instance"
msgstr "Parallel Multi Instance"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Parallel Multi Instance** — параллельная активность с несколькими "
"экземплярами."
msgstr "**Parallel Multi Instance** — parallel activity with multiple instances."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:53
msgid ""
"Все экземпляры создаются при активации тела активности с несколькими "
"экземплярами. Экземпляры выполняются одновременно и независимо друг от "
"друга."
msgstr ""
"All instances are created when the body of the multi-instance activity is"
" activated. Instances are executed simultaneously and independently of "
"each other."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:59
msgid ""
"Подробно о `Multi instance "
"<https://docs.camunda.org/manual/7.8/reference/bpmn20/tasks/task-markers"
"/#multiple-instance>`_."
msgstr ""
"Details about `Multi instance "
"<https://docs.camunda.org/manual/7.8/reference/bpmn20/tasks/task-markers"
"/#multiple-instance>`_."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:62
msgid "Настройки"
msgstr "Settings"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:65
#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:104
msgid "Пользовательская задача"
msgstr "User Task"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:67
msgid ""
"Если выбрано parallel или sequential multi-instance, то задачи будут "
"назначаться на **authority** из ролей — пользователи записываются в "
"**assignee**, группы в **candidateGroup**."
msgstr ""
"If parallel or sequential multi-instance is selected, tasks will be "
"assigned to **authority** from roles — users are written to **assignee**,"
" groups to **candidateGroup**."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:69
msgid ""
"При выставлении флага **«Ручное назначение»** появляется возможность "
"указать реципиентов:"
msgstr ""
"When the **\"Manual assignment\"** flag is set, it becomes possible to "
"specify recipients:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:75
msgid "Подробно :ref:`о реципиентах <user_task>`."
msgstr "Details :ref:`about recipients <user_task>`."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:78
msgid "Общие настройки множественного экземпляра"
msgstr "General Multi-instance Settings"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:80
msgid ""
"Настройки, аналогичные для **Пользовательской задачи**, :ref:`Скриптовой "
"задачи <script_task>` и :ref:`Подпроцесса <sub_process>`:"
msgstr ""
"Settings similar to those for **User Task**, :ref:`Script Task "
"<script_task>`, and :ref:`Subprocess <sub_process>`:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:91
msgid "**Количество повторений цикла / Loop cardinality**"
msgstr "**Loop Cardinality**"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:92
msgid "Прямое указание числа экземпляров."
msgstr "Direct specification of the number of instances."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:93
msgid "**Условие завершения / Completion condition**"
msgstr "**Completion Condition**"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:94
msgid ""
"Выражение, которое вычисляется каждый раз, когда заканчивается один "
"экземпляр."
msgstr "An expression that is evaluated each time one instance completes."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:95
msgid "**Коллекция / Collection**"
msgstr "**Collection**"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:96
msgid "Коллекция, в которой экземпляр будет создан для каждого элемента."
msgstr "A collection for which an instance will be created for each element."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:97
msgid "**Переменная элемента / Element variable**"
msgstr "**Element Variable**"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:98
msgid ""
"Переменная процесса, которая будет установлена для каждого созданного "
"экземпляра, содержащего элемент указанной коллекции."
msgstr ""
"A process variable that will be set for each created instance, containing"
" the element from the specified collection."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:101
msgid "Примеры использования"
msgstr "Usage examples"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/ecos_bpmn_components_multi_instance.rst:106
msgid ""
"Как в пользовательской задаче указать, что задачи должны идти параллельно"
" на пользователей, указанных в переменной."
msgstr ""
"How to specify in a user task that tasks should run in parallel for users"
" specified in a variable."

